---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
    <section class="pt-40 pb-32 px-6">
        <div class="container-tight max-w-3xl !px-0">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-12">Terms of Service.</h1>
            <div class="space-y-10 text-zinc-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                    <p>By accessing AZAP, you agree to be bound by these terms. We provide a platform connecting home owners with independent service providers.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">2. Service Quality</h2>
                    <p>While we vet all providers, AZAP acts as an intermediary. We use NFC verification to mitigate risk and ensure accountability.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-3">3. Payments</h2>
                    <p>Payments are handled securely through our platform. Cancellations must be made within 24 hours of the scheduled service.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
